  Scrolling two lines with even line count and 'scrolloff' set.\r\nSolution:   Adjust how the topline is computed.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/1d6539cf36a7b6d1afe76fb6316fe662f543bf60\r\n\r\nCherry-pick test_scroll_opt.vim changes from patch 8.2.1432.\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Bram Moolenaar <Bram@vim.org>\r\n\r\n\r\n#### vim-patch:9.0.1310: 'splitkeep' test has failures\r\n\r\nProblem:    'splitkeep' test has failures.\r\nSolution:   Adjust expected cursor line position.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/fdbd14e89207dca95549f298ee468793da852086\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Bram Moolenaar <Bram@vim.org>\r\n\r\n\r\n#### vim-patch:9.0.1312: Cursor position wrong when splitting window in insert mode\r\n\r\nProblem:    Cursor position wrong when splitting window in insert mode.\r\nSolution:   Pass the actual mode to win_fix_cursor(). (Luuk van Baal,\r\n            closes vim/vim#11999,\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/bc3dc298b37820a8212e7d839e882e07d6cc98c8\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Luuk van Baal <luukvbaal@gmail.com>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/22275/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/22275/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":8531849768,"node_id":"CE_lADOAPphoM5LaQRrzwAAAAH8ibIo","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/events/8531849768","actor":{"login":"zeertzjq","id":35768171,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzY4MTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35768171?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq","html_url":"https://github.com/zeertzjq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_